{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-11","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If, as whole is to whole, so is a number subtracted to a number subtracted, the remainder will also be to the remainder as whole to whole.","book":7,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","contentId":"euclid-7-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb6383b85af402925cc45cbf9f0753a915e86bb346d2c461c30dfc73e2a31230","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-11.statement","euclid-7-11.proof.1","euclid-7-11.proof.2","euclid-7-11.proof.3","euclid-7-11.conclusion","euclid-7-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7effaf242e872904c653ce2c83e21fb82c779c8c88db135276e955ac66cc3f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If, as whole is to whole, so is a number subtracted to a number subtracted, the remainder will also be to the remainder as whole to whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果整体与整体之比等于减去数字后减去数字的比,则其余部分也将等于整个剩余部分"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f639dc04f22057adb0a54c05d0e5e35e5dfac8b1183f92e25a9237aae0c178c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"As the whole AB is to the whole CD, so let AE subtracted be to CF subtracted; I say that the remainder EB is also to the remainder FD as the whole AB to the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于整个AB是整个CD,因此,让我们把AE减为CF;我说,其余EB也是其余FD,整个AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c9ece5e714ff7835e23676fcc5d15e41cff70e5505dd79a6a460d5ee67ed85d","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, as AB is to CD, so is AE to CF, whatever part or parts AB is of CD, the same part or the same parts is AE of CF also; [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB对CD的比等于AE对CF的比,无论部分或部分为AB,同一部分或相同部分为CF,AE；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AE 与 CF 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"063b1d5785e24c133fb0e81c485ba19511a7bca013b635136cfd15b40cf4c259","citations":["euclid-7-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also the remainder EB is the same part or parts of FD that AB is of CD. [[VII. 7, 8](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余EB份也是FD份的同一部分,AB份为CD份。 [[VII. 7, 8](/principles/euclid-7-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e0a1df258c9beaf489a53ad8e58bab54861beffc4f7b40eed85542881d43550","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as EB is to FD, so is AB to CD. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EB对FD的比等于AB对CD的比；EB 与 FD 之比等于 AB 与 CD 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-11.source","contentId":"euclid-7-11","revisionId":"euclid-7-11@raw-eb6383b85af40292","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2da87b6dd940f5e19a0c4c2f1c4c2b1ec4784739b0204e741e69cbafcf450519","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-11.proof.2","euclid-7-11.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-11:euclid-7-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-11","sourceBlockId